# Profile: fast
# Lowest latency. Measured 2.1 GB of RAM while loaded and about 0.19 s per warm
# request, versus 0.45 s for standard. Fits an 8 GB machine.
# Base model license: Apache 2.0 (commercial use permitted).
# Granite is a plain transformer, so Ollama caches the prompt-and-examples prefix
# between requests; the Qwen3.5 profiles cannot use that cache and re-evaluate
# it every time. The price is lower edit quality: see the README.
FROM granite3.3:2b

PARAMETER temperature 0.0
PARAMETER num_ctx 4096
